  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:42.530" end="00:50.530" ttm:agent="v1">Baby you're still my girl</p>
      <p begin="00:52.300" end="01:00.300" ttm:agent="v1">Baby you're still my girl</p>
      <p begin="01:01.900" end="01:09.900" ttm:agent="v1">Baby you're still my girl</p>
      <p begin="01:11.800" end="01:19.800" ttm:agent="v1">Baby you're still my girl</p>
      <p begin="01:21.470" end="01:26.170" ttm:agent="v1">Feelings, they can be shortened with a distortion</p>
      <p begin="01:26.170" end="01:30.840" ttm:agent="v1">We were thinking of strong generals and getting old</p>
      <p begin="01:30.840" end="01:35.450" ttm:agent="v1">And I've been waiting for you to come back, I shouldn't have done that</p>
      <p begin="01:35.450" end="01:38.640" ttm:agent="v1">Now that you're gone I can't accept that</p>
      <p begin="01:38.640" end="01:40.140" ttm:agent="v1">Because you won't come back</p>
      <p begin="01:40.120" end="01:45.170" ttm:agent="v1">Fortune, it seems so easy, but it's so hard</p>
      <p begin="01:45.170" end="01:50.280" ttm:agent="v1">And everything about you compares to the stars</p>
      <p begin="01:50.280" end="01:55.110" ttm:agent="v1">I can not</p>
      <p begin="01:55.110" end="01:59.050" ttm:agent="v1">And no</p>
      <p begin="01:59.050" end="02:07.050" ttm:agent="v1">I can, baby, you're still my</p>
      <p begin="02:09.000" end="02:17.000" ttm:agent="v1">Girl baby you're still my</p>
      <p begin="02:18.680" end="02:26.680" ttm:agent="v1">Girl baby you're still my</p>
      <p begin="02:28.560" end="02:36.560" ttm:agent="v1">Girl baby you're still my girl</p>
      <p begin="02:36.970" end="02:40.970" ttm:agent="v1"/>
    </div>
